OL,3,GNEWSASpiders nightclub inspires play at
OL,4,AHull Truck
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe writer of a new play set in a well
OL,7,Fknown alternative nightclub says she
OL,8,Fwas inspired by her own experiences of
OL,9,Fpartying there when she was younger.
OL,11,FSpiders, which has been written by
OL,12,FMartha Godber, follows two teenagers as
OL,13,Fthey navigate their friendship against
OL,14,Fthe backdrop of Spiders Nightclub in
OL,15,FHull.
OL,17,FThe production will open at Hull Truck
OL,18,FTheatre on 28 January 2027 until 13
OL,19,FFebruary.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
