OL,3,GNEWSASpiders nightclub inspires play at
OL,4,AHull Truck
OL,5,
OL,6,FGodber said: "Spiders Nightclub such an
OL,7,Ficonic place - I really don't think
OL,8,Fthere is anywhere else like it. I've
OL,9,Fhad so many memorable nights there, and
OL,10,FI really wanted to celebrate that
OL,11,Fthrough this piece of work."
